<title>HONG KONG: Jardine Int'l Motor 1996 net down 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Jardine Int'l Motor 1996 net down 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	   14.43   vs 22.44</p>
<p>    Dividend (U.S. cents)    6.3     vs 6.3</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil     vs 43.8 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    68.9    vs 107.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,007.4 vs 1,866.5</p>
<p>    Company name		 Jardine International Motor</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 14-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Jardine International Motor is a motor vehicle trader. It also markets engineering products and services.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 7.5 U.S. cents (including interim dividend of 1.2 cents) vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
